    <section class="section engineering" id="engineering">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-index">04 / ENGINEERING</p>
            <h2>一台机器人上场前，<br/>要经过五道关。</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-desc">比赛只有几分钟，功夫在赛场之外。方案、设计、装配、调试、复盘，每一步都决定机器人能不能按预期战斗。</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="process">
          <li class="reveal"><span class="process-num">01</span><h3>方案与仿真</h3><p>拆解规则，定义指标，完成结构方案与风险清单。</p></li>
          <li class="reveal"><span class="process-num">02</span><h3>设计与加工</h3><p>三维建模、出图，完成结构件加工与装配验证。</p></li>
          <li class="reveal"><span class="process-num">03</span><h3>装配与布线</h3><p>机械装配、线束规划、电源与气路管理。</p></li>
          <li class="reveal"><span class="process-num">04</span><h3>电控与算法</h3><p>嵌入式控制、视觉识别、导航与决策联调。</p></li>
          <li class="reveal"><span class="process-num">05</span><h3>赛场与复盘</h3><p>对抗测试、战术演练，用赛后数据修正下一版。</p></li>
        </ol>

        <div class="disciplines">
          <span class="disciplines-label">DISCIPLINES</span>
          <ul>
            <li>机械结构</li>
            <li>嵌入式电控</li>
